**Research mode:** support extended, source-grounded workflows with resumable processing and evidence tracking.

**Batch Processing mode:** process large documents and extensive question banks in manageable jobs, reusing completed results.

Each mode must correspond to real routing or workflow behaviour. Do not make a mode that changes only its label.

## Hardware-aware inference

Where supported, measure actual resource availability and suitability.

